@emergency
title: Crisis
new-page: true
is-special: true
call: status

= Crisis and budgets

<div class="ledger-section ledger-section-first"><div class="ledger-title">Current doctrines</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>COVID-19</span><b>[+ status_covid_policy +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Postal election</span><b>[+ status_postal_stance +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Abortion</span><b>[+ status_abortion_strategy +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Pandemic pressure</span><b>[+ status_pandemic_pressure +]/100</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Broken fiscal promises</span><b>[+ status_budget_breaches +]</b></div></div>

<div class="ledger-section"><div class="ledger-title">Annual confidence tests</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>2019 backing</span><b>[? if status_budget_2019_done: [+ status_budget_2019_backing +]%?][? if not status_budget_2019_done: —?]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">[? if not status_budget_2019_done: pending?][? if status_budget_2019_done and status_budget_2019_ratified: <span class="meter-good">ratified</span>?][? if status_budget_2019_done and not status_budget_2019_ratified: <span class="meter-warning">not ratified</span>?][? if status_budget_2019_done: · [+ status_budget_2019_vetoes +] caucus vetoes?]</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>2020 backing</span><b>[? if status_budget_2020_done: [+ status_budget_2020_backing +]%?][? if not status_budget_2020_done: —?]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">[? if not status_budget_2020_done: pending?][? if status_budget_2020_done and status_budget_2020_ratified: <span class="meter-good">ratified</span>?][? if status_budget_2020_done and not status_budget_2020_ratified: <span class="meter-warning">not ratified</span>?][? if status_budget_2020_done: · [+ status_budget_2020_vetoes +] caucus vetoes?]</div>
<div class="ledger-note">In opposition, these values measure a common Left voting line—not control of state spending. In government, an internal mandate must then survive coalition and chamber votes.</div></div>

[? if status_annual_budget_year > 0: <div class="ledger-section"><div class="ledger-title">Latest state budget</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Fiscal year</span><b>[+ status_annual_budget_fiscal_year +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Sejm vote</span><b>December [+ status_annual_budget_year +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Lewica posture</span><b>[+ status_annual_budget_posture +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Negotiated clause</span><b>[+ status_annual_budget_concession +]</b></div>
[? if not annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority: <div class="ledger-row"><span>Chosen priorities</span><b>[+ status_opposition_budget_priority_1 +] · [+ status_opposition_budget_priority_2 +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Parliamentary tactic</span><b>[+ status_opposition_budget_tactic +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Named rebels</span><b>[+ status_opposition_budget_named_rebels +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Amendment one</span><b>[+ status_opposition_budget_amendment_1 +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Amendment two</span><b>[+ status_opposition_budget_amendment_2 +]</b></div>?]
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Roll call</span><b>[+ status_annual_budget_yes +] yes · [+ status_annual_budget_no +] no · [+ status_annual_budget_abstain +] abstain</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Required</span><b>[+ status_annual_budget_threshold +] yes</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Result</span><b>[+ status_annual_budget_result +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">[? if status_budget_deadline_active: Constitutional deadline: [+ status_budget_deadline_label +].?][? if not status_budget_deadline_active: No active budget deadline.?]</div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">Opposition record: [+ status_opposition_budget_issue_ownership +] issue ownership · [+ status_opposition_budget_credibility +] credibility · [+ status_opposition_budget_media_attention +] media attention.</div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">Audit: [? if status_opposition_budget_audit_pending: due next year?][? if not status_opposition_budget_audit_pending: [+ status_opposition_budget_audit_result +]?].</div>
<div class="ledger-note">Opposition resources fund drafting, whips and monitoring. Only the cabinet controls expenditure and implements an adopted budget.</div></div>?]

[? if status_confidence_mode != "None" or status_confidence_present > 0: <div class="ledger-section"><div class="ledger-title">Cabinet confidence</div><div class="ledger-row"><span>Procedure</span><b>[+ status_confidence_mode +]</b></div><div class="ledger-row"><span>Candidate</span><b>[+ status_confidence_candidate +]</b></div><div class="ledger-row"><span>Roll call</span><b>[+ status_confidence_yes +] yes · [+ status_confidence_no +] no · [+ status_confidence_abstain +] abstain</b></div><div class="ledger-row"><span>Threshold</span><b>[+ status_confidence_threshold +] of [+ status_confidence_present +] present</b></div><div class="ledger-row"><span>Cabinet-party seats</span><b>[+ status_coalition_seats +]/460</b></div><div class="ledger-subrow">Outside confidence-and-supply votes are recorded only in the roll call.</div></div>?]
